trigger5 (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Implement the hardware cursor by uploading the 64x64 ARGB bitmap in
    bulk type-2 packets and sending show/move/hide packets.
  * Remove the invalid 0xD1 0x0001 display-disable that wedged the adapter
    on a mode change.
  * Restore URB completion credits after stopping I/O and add the Windows
    mode-set drain delays.
  * Suppress the expected -ENODEV submit error during disconnect.

